1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,367
Can you count the leaves?

2
00:00:02,367 --> 00:00:02,843
Woof!

3
00:00:03,243 --> 00:00:04,011
Look up!

4
00:00:04,011 --> 00:00:06,593
Leaves are falling from the trees.

5
00:00:07,343 --> 00:00:09,486
How many leaves can you see?

6
00:00:09,836 --> 00:00:11,309
Count them!

7
00:00:13,809 --> 00:00:16,634
One, two, three, four, five!

8
00:00:17,384 --> 00:00:18,298
Five leaves!

9
00:00:18,298 --> 00:00:20,308
Five leaves for our leaf pile!

10
00:00:22,958 --> 00:00:24,498
Our leaf pile is

11
00:00:24,498 --> 00:00:25,633
so big now.

12
00:00:25,983 --> 00:00:26,837
But wait.

13
00:00:26,837 --> 00:00:28,758
The leaves are wiggling!

14
00:00:29,508 --> 00:00:30,908
Crunch, crunch!

15
00:00:31,308 --> 00:00:32,746
Who is hiding in

16
00:00:32,746 --> 00:00:34,033
the leaf pile?

17
00:00:34,383 --> 00:00:36,083
Can you guess?

18
00:00:39,983 --> 00:00:41,258
It's me, Pip!

19
00:00:41,258 --> 00:00:42,215
Peekaboo!

20
00:00:42,965 --> 00:00:43,680
Hee hee!

21
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:45,760
You have leaves on your ears,

22
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:46,215
Pip!

23
00:00:46,965 --> 00:00:48,300
A big leaf pile is

24
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,889
more fun with friends!

25
00:00:52,539 --> 00:00:54,346
Share with a friend and

26
00:00:54,346 --> 00:00:56,639
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

27
00:00:57,239 --> 00:00:58,877
Watch the full story

28
00:00:58,877 --> 00:01:00,514
on Honey Bunny Kidz!
